== Trivia ==
* Haemolacria is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=915837573 this Steam Workshop item] by HiHowAreYou, originally known as Water Balloon.
* [[wikipedia:Haemolacria|Haemolacria]] is a rare condition that causes people to produce tears that are composed of blood.
* When {{C|Tainted ???}} uses Haemolacria, the tears will be black instead of red. This is purely cosmetic, and is probably a reference to how [[wikipedia:Human feces|stools]] containing dried blood are often black.
* {{Dlc|r}} Haemolacria is one of the few items that still modify tear delay instead of fire rate.
* When playing as {{C|Tainted Isaac}}, if your inventory is full, you can drop {{i|Blood Clot}} and pick it up again. Doing this would increment the amount of Blood Clot pick ups by 1 regardless of how many times you do this. By using this exploit, you could easily unlock Haemolacria without much difficulty.

